---
kind: lore
id: lore.noticeboard
title: The harbour square notice board
---

<entry id="noticeLanternWalk" on="noticeBoard" target="place.square" category="note" title="THE LANTERN WALK" priority="20" when="run.day <= 5">
  @narrator: THE LANTERN WALK — FRIDAY AT DUSK. Promenade to slipway. One lantern per household. Candles only, NO sparklers (this means you, Dennis).
</entry>

<entry id="noticeMarket" on="noticeBoard" target="place.square" category="note" title="SATURDAY MARKET" priority="10" when="run.day <= 6">
  @narrator: SATURDAY MARKET, 8 till 2. Local produce. Knife sharpening. Tide almanacs & other books (library surplus).
</entry>

<entry id="noticeTides" on="noticeBoard" target="place.square" category="note" title="Tide table">
  @narrator: A laminated tide table. Wednesday's low water is at 22:40. Someone has drawn a small blue star beside it.
</entry>

<entry id="noticeWalkThanks" on="noticeBoard" target="place.square" category="note" title="Thank you" when="run.day > 5">
  <match on="quest.festivalLantern.state">
    <when is="complete">
      @narrator: THANK YOU to everyone who walked. Special mention: the shop on Tern Street, back after a year off. Forty-one years!
    </when>
    <otherwise>
      @narrator: THANK YOU to everyone who walked. The committee will be collecting stray sticks from the slipway on Sunday.
    </otherwise>
  </match>
</entry>
